{"line": "5 \"ATLANTIS\" \"1995-01-01\"", "expect": ["q5 unknown_region"], "forbid": ["q5 fast", "q5 window_empty", "q5 fallback"], "note": "nonexistent region: guard-false early return, exact empty"}
